koinos-hwcaps-ifunc (1.0-1~koinos1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of IFUNC resolvers for RVV 1.0 vectorized routines
  * Provides IFUNC resolvers for memcpy, memset, memcmp, strlen, strcmp
  * Resolvers query hwprobe syscall for RVA23U64 support
  * Part of Agile611 Koinos RISC-V hwcaps infrastructure

 -- Agile611 Koinos RISC-V Project <koinos@agile611.com>  Wed, 20 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0100
